      "description": "Watch Sao Paulo vs Coritiba highlights and goals from Brasileirão on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on August 16, 2026. In a match defined by tactical intensity and physical grit, Sao Paulo and Coritiba squared off in a balanced affair in the Brazilian Serie A . The clash, which took place on August 16, 2026 , tested the resilience of both squads throughout a hard-fought ninety minutes. The flow of the game The encounter began with a cagey approach, as both teams prioritized defensive structure. Early pressure saw Tiago pick up a yellow card just five minutes into the game. The deadlock was finally broken in the 43rd minute when Pablo Maia converted a strike off an assist from Joao Victor , handing Sao Paulo a crucial lead heading into the halftime break. Second half surge Returning for the second half, Coritiba looked to shift the momentum in their favor. Their persistence paid off in the 57th minute when Tiago found the back of the net following a well-worked assist from Breno Lopes , leveling the score. Despite late tactical adjustments—including multiple substitutions for both sides—the intensity remained high, marked by a booking for Lucas Ramon in the 68th minute. Neither team could find a decisive winner, and the referee signaled the end of proceedings in the 90+6th minute."
